@props(['name', 'size' => null, 'label' => null]){{-- Interface icon. Usage: <x-icon name="pencil" /> (decorative), <x-icon name="printer" size="16" />, <x-icon name="search" label="Search" /> (standalone, named). Static tags are compiled straight to App\View\Icons::svg() (see IconServiceProvider); this component is the fallback for dynamic or Alpine attributes and draws the same svg (Blade's component syntax drops the newline after the tag; the compiled call keeps it, like inline svg did). --}}{!! \App\View\Icons::svg($name, $attributes->getAttributes(), $size, $label) !!}